<title>HUNGARY: FORECAST-Hungary T-bill, bond yields seen mixed.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-Hungary T-bill, bond yields seen mixed.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian discount Treasury bill and government security yields are likely to move in mixed directions at this week's auctions, dealers said on Monday.</p>
<p>The Government Debt Management Agency will auction one-month T-bills on Tuesday, three-month T-bills on Wednesday, three-year government bonds of the 2000/E series and seven-year bonds of the 2004/F series on Thursday.</p>
<p>		    ONE-MONTH   THREE-MONTH   3-YEAR     7-YEAR</p>
